+{"schemaVersion":"1","kind":"finding","id":"fnd_01M2GH5AT8SW3Z6ZTZ73YN7QY6","companyId":"example-co","title":"Unverified binary download in mcp-publish.yml, and deploy/aws/Dockerfile silently ignores its own version pin","description":"mcp-publish.yml:22 runs `curl -L .../mcp-publisher_...tar.gz | tar xz mcp-publisher` with no checksum or signature check, then executes that binary in a job holding `id-token: write` (mcp-publish.yml:11-13) to publish to the MCP registry. Separately, deploy/aws/Dockerfile:3 declares `ARG VERSION=latest` and labels the image `version=${VERSION}`, but deploy/aws/Dockerfile:9 hardcodes `RUN npm install -g mongodb-mcp-server@latest`, ignoring VERSION entirely -- every AWS-image rebuild installs whatever is newest on npm regardless of the version the build was supposedly pinned to. Severity is the catalog defaultSeverity of sebi-cscrf-2024 PR.IP.S4 (high). SLA topic: patch-sla.\n\nRefutation: evidence lens not refuted (The evidence holds, but the control mapping needs repair. mcp-publish.yml:22 really does pipe `curl -L .../latest/download/mcp-publisher_*.tar.gz` into `tar xz`, then runs `./mcp-publisher login github-oidc` and `publish` under `id-token: write`. publish.yml calls it on every new `latest` release. deploy/aws/Dockerfile:3 has `ARG VERSION=latest` and :9 hardcodes `npm install -g mongodb-mcp-server@latest`. The SARIF export has a CICD-PIN-03 fail result with the same fingerprint. sebi-cscrf-2024:PR.DS.S6 does not apply to example-co (mid-size-re exempt, and no control record exists for it), so the nearest applicable control is PR.IP.S4, which no reCategory filter excludes, lists probe-cicd-env and also defaults to high; severity high stands.); regulatory-mapping lens not refuted (The cited primary clause sebi-cscrf-2024:PR.DS.S6 does not bind example-co. The fix is sebi-cscrf-2024:PR.IP.S4 (\"Scan critical software for malicious code\"), which binds every RE except Small-size and Self-certification, has a ledger control record, and defaultSeverity high, so severity stays high. sebi-cscrf-2024 is correctly first, nist-ssdf-800-218 PW.4.1 is a valid global secondary.)","severity":"high","confidence":"confirmed","controlIds":["sebi-cscrf-2024:PR.IP.S4"],"regulatoryRefs":[{"regulator":"SEBI","instrument":"sebi-cscrf-2024","controlId":"PR.IP.S4"},{"regulator":"NIST","instrument":"nist-ssdf-800-218","controlId":"PW.4.1"}],"target":{"type":"repo","appId":"mcp-gateway","repoId":"mongodb-mcp-server"},"location":{"path":".github/workflows/mcp-publish.yml","startLine":20,"endLine":22},"fingerprint":"454afe95e14049bfd1a5ae7a9be94a2c724c1e2cb7b8661307bdb1187c0cd007","source":{"kind":"sarif","ruleId":"CICD-PIN-03","tool":"maxwell-cicd-auditor","toolVersion":"1.0.0"},"status":"open","slaDueAt":"2026-09-21T13:48:42Z","slaBasis":{"instrument":"sebi-cscrf-2024","controlId":"PR.MA.S3","topic":"patch-sla","severity":"high","days":7},"relatedObservationIds":[],"firstSeenAt":"2026-09-14T13:48:42Z","lastSeenAt":"2026-09-14T13:48:42Z","evidence":[{"type":"workspace-file","ref":"applications/mcp-gateway/repos/mongodb-mcp-server/.github/workflows/mcp-publish.yml","description":"unverified curl+tar extraction"},{"type":"workspace-file","ref":"applications/mcp-gateway/repos/mongodb-mcp-server/deploy/aws/Dockerfile","description":"ARG VERSION ignored, hardcoded @latest"},{"type":"sarif","ref":"kpis/data/raw/sessions/1a5b055e-58b2-4969-9611-d47c345c064a/probe-cicd-env.mcp-gateway.mongodb-mcp-server.sarif.export.json","description":"CICD-PIN-03 result","sha256":"dc357366ff0f5fbd47e3a1b9e407d5d877f6c5dc16552f0f4c709686ba3c151d"}],"tags":["cicd","supply-chain","static-probe","pinning"],"recordedAt":"2026-09-14T14:46:47Z","provenance":{"harness":"claude-code","generatedAt":"2026-09-14T13:48:42Z","sessionId":"1a5b055e-58b2-4969-9611-d47c345c064a","runId":"run_01M2FGNVVQ15ZKXZWGW74YWAAQ","workflow":"probe-cicd-env","agent":"soc-ledger-keeper"}}
