+{"schemaVersion":"1","kind":"observation","id":"obs_01M2GJT53BPGENG0VRARSM1K13","recordedAt":"2026-09-14T18:08:50Z","companyId":"example-co","controlIds":["sebi-cscrf-2024:PR.AA.S1"],"supersedes":"obs_01M2FVWKNVPDN4FV1B9FQ0YEWH","title":"Credential issuance for the MongoDB MCP gateway's Azure Container App is disabled by the tracked default template","description":"MongoDB credentials are handled correctly: main.bicep declares mdbConnectionString as @secure() (line 69) and passes it only through a Container App secretRef (lines 96-108, 157), and both tracked parameter files use the '<MONGODB_CONNECTION_STRING>' placeholder rather than a literal value. But no credential is required of callers of the deployed HTTP endpoint itself: authMode defaults to 'NOAUTH' in main.bicep (line 53), which sets MDB_MCP_HTTP_AUTH_MODE=none (lines 135-140) and skips the containerAppAuth child resource (line 185, guarded by authMode == 'MicrosoftMIBasedAuth'). deploy/azure/bicep/params_template.json, the tracked default parameter file, keeps authMode: NOAUTH (line 21) and is literally named 'mongo-mcp-without-auth' (line 5). Env qa and prod both attribute this module via iac[].path 'deploy' and both classify data as pii, financial. Commit aaa72a040db4c32f3d6488d5e28e2892a68e9ee0.","methods":["probe-iac"],"subjects":[{"type":"repo","appId":"mcp-gateway","repoId":"mongodb-mcp-server"}],"collectedAt":"2026-09-14T18:08:50Z","expiresAt":"2026-10-14T18:08:50Z","result":"partial","toolOutput":{"format":"sarif","path":"kpis/data/raw/sessions/ba28bc2c-2822-41eb-92a8-b6389d3f1d0d/probe-iac.mcp-gateway.mongodb-mcp-server.sarif.export.json","sha256":"5b29e0ed1bfa28809f81d34e55648dda20c31112a65dd894f8ecf5bf4f03f7bb"},"evidence":[{"type":"workspace-file","ref":"applications/mcp-gateway/repos/mongodb-mcp-server/deploy/azure/bicep/main.bicep","description":"authMode default and containerAppAuth condition, lines 48-219"},{"type":"workspace-file","ref":"applications/mcp-gateway/repos/mongodb-mcp-server/deploy/azure/bicep/params_template.json","description":"tracked default parameter file, authMode: NOAUTH"},{"type":"workspace-file","ref":"applications/mcp-gateway/env/prod.json","description":"exposure: partner, dataClassification: [pii, financial], iac[].path: deploy"},{"type":"sarif","ref":"kpis/data/raw/sessions/ba28bc2c-2822-41eb-92a8-b6389d3f1d0d/probe-iac.mcp-gateway.mongodb-mcp-server.sarif.export.json","description":"IAC-EXP-05 and IAC-SEC-01 results","sha256":"5b29e0ed1bfa28809f81d34e55648dda20c31112a65dd894f8ecf5bf4f03f7bb"}],"tags":["iac","static-probe"],"provenance":{"harness":"claude-code","generatedAt":"2026-09-14T18:08:50Z","sessionId":"ba28bc2c-2822-41eb-92a8-b6389d3f1d0d","runId":"run_01M2FGNVVQ15ZKXZWGW74YWAAQ","workflow":"probe-iac","agent":"soc-ledger-keeper"}}
