+{"schemaVersion":"1","kind":"observation","id":"obs_01M2GJT5571NMNHVA729XDW07Z","recordedAt":"2026-09-14T18:08:50Z","companyId":"example-co","controlIds":["dpdp-rules-2025:6(1)(b)"],"supersedes":"obs_01M2FVWKD2NF2JZ3CKGTST6M9G","title":"Security safeguards for personal data are undermined by the default no-auth, write-enabled MCP gateway template","description":"env qa and env prod both classify data as pii and financial and reside in IN. The tracked default deployment template (params_template.json) provisions the MongoDB MCP gateway with authMode NOAUTH (line 21) and MDB_MCP_READ_ONLY: 'false' (line 12), i.e. unauthenticated read+write access to personal and financial data stores if this template is used as shipped. Reasonable security safeguards under DPDP Rule 6(1)(b) require access control commensurate with the data's sensitivity; encryption/localisation (residency: IN, logsInIndia: true) are otherwise in order per env json. Commit aaa72a040db4c32f3d6488d5e28e2892a68e9ee0.","methods":["probe-iac"],"subjects":[{"type":"repo","appId":"mcp-gateway","repoId":"mongodb-mcp-server"}],"collectedAt":"2026-09-14T18:08:50Z","expiresAt":"2026-10-14T18:08:50Z","result":"partial","toolOutput":{"format":"sarif","path":"kpis/data/raw/sessions/ba28bc2c-2822-41eb-92a8-b6389d3f1d0d/probe-iac.mcp-gateway.mongodb-mcp-server.sarif.export.json","sha256":"5b29e0ed1bfa28809f81d34e55648dda20c31112a65dd894f8ecf5bf4f03f7bb"},"evidence":[{"type":"workspace-file","ref":"applications/mcp-gateway/repos/mongodb-mcp-server/deploy/azure/bicep/params_template.json","description":"authMode: NOAUTH, MDB_MCP_READ_ONLY: false"},{"type":"workspace-file","ref":"applications/mcp-gateway/env/qa.json","description":"dataClassification: [pii, financial], residency: [IN]"},{"type":"sarif","ref":"kpis/data/raw/sessions/ba28bc2c-2822-41eb-92a8-b6389d3f1d0d/probe-iac.mcp-gateway.mongodb-mcp-server.sarif.export.json","description":"IAC-EXP-05 result","sha256":"5b29e0ed1bfa28809f81d34e55648dda20c31112a65dd894f8